      "content": "That hits the nail on the head. Calling it \"moral cowardice\" is going to really provoke a reaction, which is exactly what I want.\n\nOne more thing—to really drive the point home, I want to end the speech by characterizing the people who stay home not just as \"bystanders,\" but as people who are actively complicit in the problems facing our city. Can you write a closing statement that frames non-voters as people who are essentially undermining our democracy by their very inaction?",
